  <lyrics>
    <verse name="v1">
      <lines>
      <chord name="C"/>And <chord name="Dm/A"/>have <chord name="Bb"/>the <chord name="C7/Bb"/>bright immensities<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>Received <chord name="Bb"/>our <chord name="F/C"/>risen <chord name="Gm/D"/>Lord,<br/>
      <chord name="C7/Bb"/>Where light <chord name="Dm/A"/>years <chord name="C"/>frame <chord name="Dm/A"/>the <chord name="Bb"/>Pleiades<br/>
      <chord name="C7/Bb"/>And point Orion’s <chord name="F"/>sword?<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>Do flaming suns His <chord name="Gm/D"/>footsteps <chord name="Dm/A"/>trace<br/>
      <chord name="Dm/A"/>Thro’ corridors <chord name="C7"/>sublime,<br/>
      <chord name="C7/Bb"/>The Lord <chord name="Am"/>of <chord name="F"/>interstellar space<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>And conqueror <chord name="C/E"/>of time?
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v2">
      <lines>
      <chord name="C"/>The <chord name="Dm/A"/>heav&#x27;n <chord name="Bb"/>that <chord name="F/C"/>hides <chord name="C7"/>Him from <chord name="F"/>our sight<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>Knows neither near nor <chord name="Gm/D"/>far;<br/>
      <chord name="C7/Bb"/>A little <chord name="C"/>candle <chord name="Dm/A"/>sheds <chord name="Bb"/>its <chord name="F/C"/>light<br/>
      <chord name="C7/Bb"/>As surely <chord name="F"/>as a <chord name="C/G"/>star.<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>And where <chord name="Bb"/>His <chord name="F/C"/>loving <chord name="Gm/D"/>people <chord name="Dm/A"/>meet<br/>
      <chord name="Dm/A"/>To share <chord name="Am"/>the <chord name="F"/>gift <chord name="C7"/>divine,<br/>
      <chord name="C7/Bb"/>There stands <chord name="Am"/>He <chord name="F"/>with unhurrying feet;<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>There heav&#x27;nly splendors <chord name="C/E"/>shine.
      </lines>
    </verse>
  </lyrics>
